<title>UK: BOE buys bills/frg totalling 500 mln stg.</title>
<headline>BOE buys bills/frg totalling 500 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it bought bills/frg totalling 500 million stg for resale to the market in equal amounts on February 10 and 11 at set rates.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.0 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    500 MLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p>BILLS/FRG FEB 10/11  500 MLN!</p>
<p>!AT INTERST RATE OF 5-31/32 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
